Package: rsixel
Title: Encoding and Decoding Sixel Images
Version: 0.0.3
Authors@R: 
    person("Weifan", "Lv", , "lvweifan@pku.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a native R implementation for encoding and decoding 'sixel'
    graphics (<https://vt100.net/docs/vt3xx-gp/chapter14.html>), and a dedicated
    'sixel' graphics device that allows plots to be rendered directly within
    compatible terminal emulators.
